{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99858","id":2208035499,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Dm_Kr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99858","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99858.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99858","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99858/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99858/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99858/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3d6d268be2ff15c0c86e7d7aacf449f20ff81033","number":99858,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move reimport check to EditorImportPlugin","user":{"login":"demolke","id":153469044,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSXAdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153469044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke","html_url":"https://github.com/demolke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/demolke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"reimport_append is used by gltf_document, fbx_document and editor_import_plugin. The first two will never call it when importing == false. It's only the editor_import_plugin that should guard against that. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_editorimportplugin.html#class-editorimportplugin-method-append-import-external-resource\r\n\r\nThe motivation of removing the check from gltf_document call path is to be able to test nested imports (texture embedded in gltf).\r\n\r\nRelated to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98909 which is trying to introduce editor import tests (as opposed to runtime import test).\r\n\r\nI originally though of doing it by introducing a test hint (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99848), but it's probably better not to riddle the code with `if test` statements.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-11-30T00:00:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T12:26:55Z","closed_at":"2025-01-07T12:25:22Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c76109b5c2752f11907cc859c7056b1f1d468baf","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":